---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'May 29, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - The Flux Capacitor"
  description="Privacy policy for ghidini.net"
>
  <article class="prose-content">
    <h1 class="mb-2 text-3xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-(--color-text-secondary)">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <section class="mb-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Introduction</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-(--color-text-secondary)">
        Welcome to ghidini.net. I respect your privacy and am committed to protecting your personal
        data. This privacy policy explains how I handle information when you visit my website, in
        compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Data Controller</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-(--color-text-secondary)">
        The data controller for this website is Alessandro Ghidini. You can contact me at: <a
          href="mailto:privacy@ghidini.net"
          class="text-(--color-accent) hover:underline">privacy@ghidini.net</a
        >
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. What Data I Collect</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-(--color-text-secondary)">
        This is a static website. I do not collect, store, or process any personal data directly.
        Specifically:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-(--color-text-secondary)">
        <li>No cookies are set by this website</li>
        <li>No user accounts or registration</li>
        <li>No contact forms that store data</li>
        <li>No analytics or tracking scripts</li>
        <li>No advertising networks</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Hosting</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-(--color-text-secondary)">
        This website is hosted as a static site. The hosting provider may collect technical data
        such as IP addresses in server logs for security purposes. This processing is based on the
        legitimate interest of ensuring the security and availability of the website (Art. 6(1)(f)
        GDPR).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-(--color-text-secondary)">
        This website may embed content from third-party services (e.g., code examples, fonts). These
        services may collect data according to their own privacy policies. I recommend reviewing the
        privacy policies of any third-party services referenced in my content.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-(--color-text-secondary)">
        Under the GDPR, you have the right to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-(--color-text-secondary)">
        <li>Access any personal data held about you</li>
        <li>Rectification of inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Erasure of your data</li>
        <li>Restrict processing of your data</li>
        <li>Data portability</li>
        <li>Object to processing</li>
        <li>Lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">7. Local Storage</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-(--color-text-secondary)">
        This website uses browser local storage solely to remember your theme preference (light or
        dark mode). This data never leaves your device and is not transmitted to any server. You can
        clear this data at any time through your browser settings.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-(--color-text-secondary)">
        I may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page
        with an updated revision date.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
